Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awesome treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hidden at the end of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the courage that sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}fedew\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Gab\NGalaxy 9000\NGol D. Rocks\NPepperjack\NWestfal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the compass points our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back,\Ntake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab\NVillager
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}funnynaoto\NGordingus\NPollychan\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.17,0:01:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.83,0:01:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried\Nonly helps our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Funimation\NPamkinPinguin\Nspicyapples
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.25,0:01:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.11,0:01:56.07,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H181818&\3c&H181818&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(479,726)\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\t(5192,5234,\1a&HFF&)}Finale
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.11,0:01:56.07,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(479,726)}Finale
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They ran away and left the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we couldn't even give them a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after all they did for us, I wonder if\Nthey realize how much we appreciate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't know how we feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Issie,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not fair that you were the only\None that got to say goodbye to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.07,0:02:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's really upset that we\Nlet our heroes just run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Luffy and the others made\Nme promise to keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lock, did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy can stretch his body really far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.67,0:02:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's like a Gum-Gum pistol. Cape! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.83,0:02:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Issie, please, you've got to hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never knew there were warriors\Nlike him in the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.37,0:02:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be just like him when I grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Gum-Gum warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to trim your hair a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to let it grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it'll look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you've forgotten you're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And girls should look cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.19,0:03:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Cute? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not With the war over,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no need for kids like\Nyou to carry weapons anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.45,0:03:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can enjoy life the way it was\Nmeant to be, and as a proper young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never knew you were so ladylike.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Issie. Now hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky's ladylike!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Issie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great warrior Call 'gara, we were told\Nthe Shandorian's role has been fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for your last wish, it was\Ndelivered to your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our future generations will\Nno longer have to shed blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are finally at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The war may be over, but one thing\Nthat will never end is our pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.29,0:04:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please continue to guide us, mighty\NKalgara, and watch over us as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We solemnly swear, the fire\Nof Shandora will never die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot abandon my duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the Sky Knight, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should be looking at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, this city originally\Nbelonged to your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.65,0:04:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It did, long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that means nothing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, with this battle,\Nall of us realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birth belongs to no group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our world has two sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The land is called\NSkypiea, the city Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have been torn\Nasunder by war for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a man who has long lamented that\Nwar can unite them and that man is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:05:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Sky Knight Gonfall, I'd like\Nyou to take Skypiea's throne again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only you can heal the deep wounds\Nthat scar this land of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.57,0:05:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd like you to do it too, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gonfall, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.69,0:05:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We Shandians are behind you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.99,0:05:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gonfall! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.31,0:05:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I was thinking\Nthat I'd finally be able
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get some rest and\Ntend to my pumpkin patch.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.14,0:05:50.93,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,160)\fad(2560,0)}Lower Skypiea,\Nthe White Sea
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.14,0:05:50.93,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H3A3938&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,160)\3c&H3A3938&\fad(2560,0)\t(2518,2560,\1a&H00&)}Lower Skypiea,\Nthe White Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:06:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay we're almost there everyone see that\Nup ahead that's cloud end whoa let me see
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh so that's where we go back down\Nfrom we got here sooner than i thought
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.17,0:06:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh we really have to go back already you\Nknow it sounds crazy but i'm actually
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna miss this place I think it's\Ntime we said goodbye to the White Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island Sheer is fun, but scary, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just go through that\Ngate and there'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a milky road that'll\Ntake us to the Blue Sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder if we'll ever\Nvisit this place again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.11,0:06:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but this is\Nas far as we can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.27,0:06:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the escort! Conis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget me, Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.65,0:06:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the others for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:06:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was nice meeting you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who should be thanking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Conis, old guy\Nfurball! Take care now! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now take in your sails and hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in for a bumpy ride. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do as the man says.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like we're\Nalready picking up speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're sliding down from\Nthousands of feet in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.65,0:07:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says don't leave without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the south bird\Nwe brought up here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, it looks like the log post has\Nthe coordinates for the next island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.17,0:07:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we get to the bottom, we'll\Nstart a brand new adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:08:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close up for finding some gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.77,0:08:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Sea, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, grab hold of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The freefall's about to start!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freefall?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One octopus balloon, on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.73,0:09:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.71,0:09:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a load of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.95,0:09:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it? A balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, ain't it great?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not falling! Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a minute there, I\Nthought we were goners.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep ringing it. Let the departing\Nheroes of this land farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Land, know how much we\Nappreciate them. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blueno!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.85,0:10:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We let you say prizes to the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.47,0:10:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you look up, you see the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though some believe it\Nto be only a legend,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is an island floating\Nthousands of feet in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you listen carefully, you\Ncan hear the tolling of a bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It rings today and it will ring again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow that bell rings from the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From a land that wandered,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it sings of its pride and\Nproclaims to the rest of the world:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a way to travel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.95,0:11:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're calling off the search? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold has been\Nin the sky this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.03,0:11:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else to be\Nfound at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.85,0:11:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dream's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No point in staying here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.09,0:11:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man! Cricket!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.59,0:11:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of you for helping me\Npursue my dream for all of these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.09,0:11:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never stop believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.37,0:11:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're leaving the Alliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since this dream's done, which\None are we going to pursue next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll all follow you to the ends\Nof the world, old man! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold! Gold! Gold! Gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally struck it rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we buy with all this loot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know a huge bronze statue! Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only an idiot would\Nexchange gold for bronze!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.77,0:12:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we need are more cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.62,0:12:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.45,0:12:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to buy a refrigerator with a lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, if you get one with a lock, there'll\Nbe no way for me to get a midnight snack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I want one, you pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you guys just hold on a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to land first, then\Nwe can divide up the treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please buy me books!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we buy everything you guys want,\Nwe're gonna be broke again in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.41,0:12:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun's completely set now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still a nice view.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.49,0:13:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami! Robin! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was really scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the octopus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it ran out of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.49,0:13:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder how that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't whine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did make it down here\Nalive. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we got to see an incredible place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we're down here,\Nit looks so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like something out of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dreamland.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think we'll see it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you might see someplace\Nsimilar when you die. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.99,0:13:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt you're going\Nanyplace good. You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys keep discussing the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, I'm gonna go put on a pot of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make dinner instead, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.75,0:14:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ever not hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have some coffee first\Nand be patient, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate treasure is always divided up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after splitting up the loot,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd all have more gold than\Nwe'd know what to do with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.56,0:14:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go and buy some stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I tell you what I want to buy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.85,0:14:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big gold statue!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I want to buy a bunch\Nof new medical books.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New pots, frying pans,\Nsilverware, giant mousetrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.17,0:14:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, even after all that,\Nthere'll still be a lot left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could buy lots of booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I take an extra cut. 80%.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not for me oh yeah\Nthen who and why should they
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,receive a bigger share than\Nthe rest of us it's for a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,special lady we're going to\Nset aside the gold to pay
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the repairs we need to\Nmake lady oh wait you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Mary that's right isn't\Nit about time we paid her
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back for all she's done for\Nus well come to think of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:15:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it the going Mary has carried\Nus for a long time now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.32,0:15:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hasn't she ever since I joined\Nup and left my village in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the east blue and that's\Nexactly why we need to give
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her some tender loving care\Ngood idea the going Mary's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great repair, let's do it\Nhere. Dig in. Oh, I've been
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wondering how much longer\NUsopp's half-ass repairs are
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna last hey I'm a sniper\Nnot a ship right right it's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time we took the Mary to a\Nreal shipyard and got some
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,honest-to-goodness shipwrights\Nto give her the repairs
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she needs so there are people\Nwho can fix ships better
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.21,0:15:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sometimes when you need a job done right\Nyou gotta go see a professional That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get a shipwright for our crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.42,0:15:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our journey's far from over, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really need someone with those\Nskills And the Mary isn't just our ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's our home too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.74,0:15:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's go find us a shipwright\Nwho can keep the Mary safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he got to the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds really good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, let's go do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope we can find somebody good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get a musician, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's forget that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all the ruckus out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megway!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit pushing! Come on! Stop it!\NLet me go! Why are they fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy! Sarquiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't someone gonna stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you making me do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Sargus bleed like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I making you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sargus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm making you do this because\Nyou've made a mockery of this symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does the Sky Island exist or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the legendary City of Gold real or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth doesn't really\Nmatter now, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You play the opposing sides off each\Nother to twist them to your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Bellamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's Don Quixote Don Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of the seven warlords of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard his bounty's over 300 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a guy like him doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've really let me down and I've got\Nzero tolerance for useless punks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control it! Please! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me one more\Nchance to set things right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear we'll loyally\Nfollow your every command.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy! Let it go, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might have lost But I've never\Nonce acted against your principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear on your symbol!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I had reasons for my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't just let the\NStraw Hats get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were bound to find you\Nsomeday if I didn't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a touching sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such genuine loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your concern for my well-being\Nis duly noted, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a new era quickly approaching,\Nso your actions here won't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still have no use for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wiped out Bellamy as\Neasily as stomping on a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was worth 55 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.40,0:19:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beginning is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're drawing close to a new world in\Nwhich only true pirates can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weak should run while they still can,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or be swept away by the\Ntides of time as they
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,roll back to reveal a\Nnew era of champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you climb into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:20:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your reflection wanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fading so silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let these words guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're windless nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.34,0:20:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.40,0:20:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you see the journey through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that you'll learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put your past behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just keep moving on.

